cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: >-
  easypaper: Automate Reproducible Quarto Manuscripts Ready for Submission
abstract: >-
  Creates and builds reproducible scientific manuscripts written in Quarto.
  create_paper() writes a project that holds only the paper: its sections as
  separate files, its references and journal style, the setup of the
  analysis and the data. The functions of the package render it for any
  journal, check citations and cross-references before every render, give the
  supplementary material a bibliography of its own, and build the submission
  folder: the manuscript split for double-blind review, together with a data
  and code compendium ready for a data repository. Every render sets the
  scientific names of the reference list in italics, and italicize_species()
  does the same for any other bibliography.
authors:
